system "Reordered socket replies"

types
  id is one of first, second

state
  pending is a map from id to boolean
  received is one of none, first, second

initially
  pending of every id is false
  received is none

action request(n is an id)
  requires not pending of n
  pending of n becomes true

action deliver(n is an id)
  requires pending of n
  pending of n becomes false
  received becomes n

scenario "Second reply overtakes first"
  request(first)
  request(second)
  deliver(second)
  expect received is second
  deliver(first)
  reject deliver(first)
